{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02457",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.05,
      "end_seconds": 7.02,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Doctor, I've brought them through. The observations are done, whenever you need them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.01,
      "end_seconds": 11.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.8,
      "end_seconds": 34.16,
      "duration_seconds": 21.36,
      "text": "Honestly, uh, it's no symptoms, and my family pushed me to come. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 35.8,
      "end_seconds": 44.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 124 over 76, heart rate 68, SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.54,
      "end_seconds": 47.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Thanks. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.15,
      "end_seconds": 54.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "About a month, I think... sorry, two months, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.8,
      "end_seconds": 63.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.97,
      "end_seconds": 69.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.6,
      "end_seconds": 73.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.32,
      "end_seconds": 101.13,
      "duration_seconds": 23.81,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get being a little overweight as well. Oh, and a high blood sugar on a routine test. That's been about the same, three days. The being a little overweight? That's been since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.91,
      "end_seconds": 105.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Has there been any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.41,
      "end_seconds": 111.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Not at all, uh, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.44,
      "end_seconds": 116.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "And what about frequent urination, blurred vision or thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.19,
      "end_seconds": 122.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "No frequent urination, blurred vision or thirst, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.76,
      "end_seconds": 129.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.54,
      "end_seconds": 133.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.46,
      "end_seconds": 148.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.55,
      "end_seconds": 171.27,
      "duration_seconds": 21.72,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. Let me think, you know, I have heart disease. I took the morning off to come in today. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.37,
      "end_seconds": 184.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "Alright, yes, high blood pressure and heart disease are known to us, good to have that clear. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.66,
      "end_seconds": 198.92,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.6,
      "end_seconds": 203.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.84,
      "end_seconds": 208.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Just a caesarean for my second baby, nine years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.11,
      "end_seconds": 229.69,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "So, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.54,
      "end_seconds": 252.47,
      "duration_seconds": 20.93,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I gave up cigarettes last spring. I hardly move around during the day. I live with my elderly mother. I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.55,
      "end_seconds": 266.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Okay, does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.5,
      "end_seconds": 273.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol. My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.87,
      "end_seconds": 278.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.71,
      "end_seconds": 284.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "I'm on losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 285.48,
      "end_seconds": 291.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 25 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.09,
      "end_seconds": 297.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Hm. Do you have the latest prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.35,
      "end_seconds": 314.79,
      "duration_seconds": 16.44,
      "text": "Well, no, I left it at home. I take clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. Though honestly, some days I forget to take it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.42,
      "end_seconds": 320.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.8,
      "end_seconds": 324.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.73,
      "end_seconds": 338.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Your blood pressure and heart rate are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.06,
      "end_seconds": 350.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. Okay, so my impression is this: The most likely explanation is prediabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.7,
      "end_seconds": 353.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.32,
      "end_seconds": 368.73,
      "duration_seconds": 14.41,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's prediabetes, and we'll know more once the a repeat HbA1c is back. I think a repeat HbA1c makes sense here, for prediabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.16,
      "end_seconds": 372.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.41,
      "end_seconds": 396.32,
      "duration_seconds": 22.91,
      "text": "Walk thirty minutes daily, cut sugary drinks and aim to lose five percent of your weight. The diabetes prevention programme would be the right next step, I'll refer you. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.09,
      "end_seconds": 398.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.04,
      "end_seconds": 405.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Come back in six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 406.89,
      "end_seconds": 408.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Yes, that's manageable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 409.54,
      "end_seconds": 412.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 413.28,
      "end_seconds": 417.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 418.68,
      "end_seconds": 420.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Okay, look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}